<% content_for :title, "About Us - Jeeni Shop" %>

<div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem;">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
    <span style="font-size: 3rem;">🌱</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--secondary); margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">About Us</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1rem;">Nourishing lives pure and simple with traditional millet blends</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="background: white; padding: 2.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-main);">
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--secondary);">Welcome to <strong>Jeevitha Enterprises (Jeeni Shop)</strong>, where health meets heritage.</p>
    
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our mission is to bring back the nutritional powerhouse of traditional Indian millets into modern, daily diets. In today's fast-paced world, finding balanced, wholesome, and pure nutrition can be a challenge. We make it easy with our premium range of millet mixes, thoughtfully formulated to support active lifestyles, weight management, and overall wellness.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">The Power of Millets</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Millets are ancient grains that have been cultivated in the Indian subcontinent for thousands of years. They are gluten-free, rich in dietary fiber, packed with essential minerals (like iron, magnesium, and calcium), and have a low glycemic index, making them ideal for everyday energy and sugar management.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">Our Quality Commitment</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">We work directly with local farmers to source the finest quality millets. Our processing methods ensure that the grains retain their wholesome nutrients, fiber, and taste. We take pride in offering products that are:</p>
    <ul style="margin-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; list-style-type: disc;">
      <li>Pure, wholesome, and vegetarian</li>
      <li>Free from added artificial colors or preservatives</li>
      <li>Formulated with a rich variety of premium millets (like Browntop, Proso, Foxtail, and Finger millets)</li>
      <li>Complemented with healthy nuts, seeds, and traditional spices</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">Our Location</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">We are proudly based in <strong>Sira, Tumkur, Karnataka</strong>—a region deeply rooted in agricultural tradition. From our facility, we package and ship our fresh millet blends daily to families across the country.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;">
    <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">🔙 Return to Shop</a>
  </div>
</div>
